window.products.push({"id":461177,"name":"NOVICA Hand Carved Natural Suar Wood Heart Shaped Floral Wall Mirror from Indonesia 'Frangipani Heart'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rvPO1OlvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Carved by hand, frangipani flowers surround a beautiful wall mirror. Sarwaedi works in Balinese suar wood with an antiqued black finish to surround the heart-shaped looking glass.    Frame: 15.25\" H x 15.0\" W x 0.8\" D    Mirror: 7.75\" W x 7.5\" H  - Designed to hang vertically only - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly - Features an aged antique finish   About our Artist: 'I was born in Sukawati, Gianyar in Bali on April 21 1970. In the town where I grew up, most people are wood carvers, and so was my family. I learned wood sculpture by watching my parents. In those days, children began learning the art at a young age and I was not alone. Today, I continue working with wood, but I'm focusing on making vases and classic boxes. I give unique finishes to my designs to distinguish them from the others.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rvPO1OlvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01BPS416O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BPS416O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BPS416O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
