window.products.push({"id":461220,"name":"Howard Miller Hamilton Wall Clock 625-561 – Polished Silver-Tone Finished Case, Classic Round Design, Reflective Finishes, Modern Home Decor, Quartz M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eTJenq0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: Decorate any space from the kitchen, home office, living room to the bedroom with the Hamilton Wall Clock. It features a polished silver-tone finished case in a classic round design for a sophisticated look. DURABLE: Imparting a functional, sturdy, modern flair, this decorative wall clock features a white dial covered by a flat glass crystal to prevent accumulation of dust and ensure long-lasting use. The silver case coordinates with the dial to match any color scheme. HIGH QUALITY: Powered by a quartz, battery-operated movement, this modern clock is graced with clear, easy-to-read black Arabic numerals, black-colored hour, minute, and second hand along with the classic Howard Miller logo at the center. DIMENSIONS: Display this Howard Miller clock with a 12 inches (30 cm) height, a width of 12 inches (30 cm), and a depth of 1.5 inches (4 cm). The quartz movement requires one AA size battery (not included). With highly polished and reflective metal finishes, natural blemishes are normal. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world's leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine, and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eTJenq0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B00GVFZ4IQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GVFZ4IQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GVFZ4IQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
