window.products.push({"id":461332,"name":"Brandream Luxury Beach Bedding Set Coastal Sheets 100% Cotton Bed Sheets Set King Size 4-Piece Deep Pockets 18 Inch Extra Deep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":92.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZQwT8twkL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"KING SIZE 4PC Set - 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, and 2 King size pillow cases. SUPER SOFT - COZY TOUCH - HIGH QUALITY 100% COTTON. BREATHABLE. STYLISH COASTAL SELECTION - NAUTICAL beach theme with seashell and coral pattern and gentle blue color DURABLE AND LONG LASTING - Cotton material is more durable and the workmanship is totally worth the price! Machine washable with gentle cycle in cold water. Sun dry or tumble low dry. Special(*) Design Fitted Sheet - Exquisite seaming running around the edge of the mattress for fitted sheet to fit your mattress neatly and perfectly - you don't have to pull and struggle with it to get the corners pulled down over the mattress.Deep Pocket 18 Inch with elastic all around - take consideration for mattress height and cotton material shrinkage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZQwT8twkL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brandream","source_asin":"B091HJKB55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091HJKB55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091HJKB55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":461333,"name":"Chevrolet Simple Vintage Bowtie Officially Licensed Silky Touch Super Soft Throw Blanket 50\" x 60\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SEtAtD7OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CHEVROLET SIMPLE VINTAGE BOWTIE ULTRA SILKY TOUCH BLANKET - 300 GSM fabric provides warmth and comfort yet is lightweight and breathable, that will make a great decorative addition to any room. SHRINK and FADE RESISTANT - our products are hand-printed in the USA using a dye sublimation process. This design has amazing color vibrancy & Made of 100% polyester that is super soft and long lasting. SIZE: 50\" x 60\" Microfiber fleece fabric with double overlock stitch to create ultra-fluffiness and durability. This all-purpose blanket makes the perfect holiday gift, birthday present, or collector's item. OFFICIALLY LICENSED - Each of our designs are officially licensed and 100% authentic. The designs are created by our incredibly talented in house graphic art team who often hand draw and illustrate each design. CARE - Our products are machine washable. Tumble dry low. Not to mention, our products are the perfect holiday gift, birthday present, or just treat yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SEtAtD7OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trevco","source_asin":"B09CR1LLZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CR1LLZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CR1LLZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":461334,"name":"Red Poppy II by Marion Rose, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PUdM6+FPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a red poppy with streaks of purple and pink. Most days, one would find Marion Rose putting on her favorite music or playing an old video before settling in to paint for the day in her spacious studio, especially once the winter chill set in. Her work is influenced by past masters such as Joaquin Sorolla, Tom Thomson, Carl Rungius, Bob Kuhn, and many others that work today in a variety of subject and media. She also studied printmaking, life painting and drawing in college in her 30's. Her subjects come from her life of traveling enthusiastically as often as she could, both close to home or across the ocean. Sketching and studying animals were a favorite pastime, setting an excellent foundation for creating authentic work. Texture and richly colored paint applied generously by knife or brush strokes capture the essence of a subject's spirit and demeanor. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PUdM6+FPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B072FJXZP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072FJXZP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072FJXZP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":461335,"name":"Nanshing K Amazon Collection Bedroom Comforter Complete 7 Piece Set, King, Black/White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913-GWpk9kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your bedroom look unique and exotic with this Amazon Comforter Set, featuring a total of 7 items. The king size comforter measures 101\" L in. x 86\" W in. and 1.5 Inches in thickness. The two regular pillow shams measures 21\" L in. x 37\" W in. There are two decorative pillows measuring 16\" L in. x 16\" W in. and 12\" L in. x 16\" W in. Includes a matching bed skirt measuring 78\" L in. x 80\" W in. with a fabulous 14-inch long skirt. The comforter, pillow shams, pillows and bed skirt features 100% polyester fabric and polyester fill for total insulation and comfort.  A gorgeous design featuring distinctive leopard and zebra pattern prints bordered with touches of luxurious black satin. A beautiful and complete set to add comfort to your bedroom.  At Nanshing, we sought to blend artistry and design. By making fantastic designs and stunning combinations, we create fine bedroom textiles that offers great value for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913-GWpk9kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nanshing","source_asin":"B005FSXLV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005FSXLV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005FSXLV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":461336,"name":"Confetti Star 3/4\" Blue Royal - Retail Pack #8623 QS0","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51azkxLAriL._AC_.jpg","description":"Click the \"Visit the Jimmy Jems Store\" link near the Product Title at the top of the page, to Visit Our Amazon Store that lists over 500 Shapes and Colors of Confetti. .. The inventor of Metallic Confetti over 30 years ago in Los Angeles. All our Confetti is shipped to you FREE FREIGHT by USPS First Class or Priority Mail... Alittle something about this Jimmy Jems Confetti Style. This is a pretty big star. Easy to toss, easy to clean, and what a statement it makes. Be Proud, to show your star!... How many pieces of confetti per Half pound? The great unknown. Each confetti style has it own unique shape and thus area and weight, thus do not count. For example a 1/4 Square would weigh more than a 1/4\" Circle, and of course a 1/2\" Star, would weigh more than both. Then we have mixed shape confetti that would never have the same exact proportion of shapes per each lb. Lastly, the weight of the material we use sometimes fluctuates. NIGHTMARE!!! So, we decided from the beginning to sell by weight and not by volume or piece. But, for an example, Jimmy instructed the crew in the back to come up with some numbers and here it goes. Remember - this is an estimate ONLY. In a half pound there are approximately 25,000 - 1/4\" Circles, and 5,000 - 3/4\" Stars","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51azkxLAriL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jimmy Jem's","source_asin":"B09PBN3RQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PBN3RQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PBN3RQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
