window.products.push({"id":461413,"name":"LINENSCAPE King Size Dark Blue Cotton Sheet Set, 600 Thread Count Egyptian Cotton Bedsheets, 15 inches Deep Pocket, 4 Piece Bedding for Home and Hotel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+TwPUNjfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY BEST COTTON BED SHEETS: If you love the feel of luxurious pure cotton hotel sheets and crisp pillowcases, you’ll adore Linenscape 600 thread count sheets. We use fine Egyptian Cotton yarns made with extra-long-staple cotton fiber and a gorgeous sateen weave. Our bed sheets get softer with each wash, long-lasting softness. Premium Egyptian Cotton Sheets Set of the utmost comfort with detailed hem styling, also available in Full, Queen, King & Cal King sheets. KING SIZE LUXURIOUS 4-Piece Bed Sheets Set - Each set includes 1 Flat Sheet, 108\" W X 102\" L; 1 Fitted Sheet, 76\" W X80\" L + 15\" with Deep pocket on the fitted sheet with superb all-around elastic to fit low profile foam and tall mattresses; and 2 King Pillowcase, 20\" W x 40\" L. Our Egyptian Cotton Sheets Set are made with highest quality dye materials are used for fade resistance. Recommended for a regular wash. CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX - All our bed sheets are STANDARD 100 by OEKO‐TEX. According to the guidelines, these products are tested for harmful substances and produced in a friendly and socially responsible manner. Each fabric batch is also tested for various durability features such as no-pilling, low shrinkage, colorfastness, etc., then stitched, individually inspected to be defect-free, and finally packed for sales. ORIGINAL 600 THREAD COUNT FABRIC: These Cool and Lightweight Sheets set is ultra-soft. These sheets have the distinctive comfort of Luxurious Hotel Class Bedding Collection Sheets at a low price. These 600 TC Cotton sheets are EASY CARE – Made from chemical-free Fade Resistant Dyes, the supreme quality cotton sheets stay bright and even tone even after extended use and wash. Machine washable cold on gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Don’t use bleach or creams as these may lead to fading of color. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Our products are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If for any reason you don't love our Sheets Set, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines. Our high-quality 600-thread-count Egyptian cotton sheets match any decor and make the ultimate gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+TwPUNjfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINENSCAPE","source_asin":"B09SKNKS1R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SKNKS1R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SKNKS1R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":461414,"name":"Twin Stainless Steel Hip Flasks - Two (2) 100 ml Travel Flasks with Black PU Leather Case by plumwood & vine (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NFpBpZCZL._AC_SL1072_.jpg","description":"The plumwood & vine Twin Flask is the ideal travel companion. Whether flying, attending a sporting event or enjoying the great outdoors, this flask is the perfect accessory. Each of the two flasks is designed to hold 100 ml of your favorite spirits. The innovative design cleverly meets TSA requirements for air travel. You won't need to check luggage anymore or pay mini bar prices when you reach your hotel. Each individual flask is wrapped in stylish PU leather and fits into a matching case. The sleek design fits discreetly and securely in the pocket of your pants or jacket. Each flask is made from quality 304 stainless steel for durability and has a leak proof, screw top lid. The plumwood & vine Twin Flask makes the perfect gift for the fun-loving person in your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NFpBpZCZL._AC_SL1072_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"plumwood & vine","source_asin":"B01H2J80Y4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H2J80Y4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H2J80Y4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
