window.products.push({"id":461426,"name":"SleepPeanut Bluetooth Smart Sleep Monitor and Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yOmuaJi8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description SleepPeanut is a Smart Wake up Alarm Clock that wakes you up at the right timerefreshed and energized. Into your bed, SleepPeanut seamlessly monitors your sleep quality and cycles. It adapts the time of your wake up alarm to your personal body clock, looking for a light sleep to make you jumpstart the day. From the Manufacturer Experience soft and awesome wake up programs. Choose amongst 14 beautiful wake up ringtones played by your smartphone to enjoy your morning. Also, SleepPeanut Built-In Speaker can play a discreet wake up sound only you can hear to rise and shine in a very new way — without waking up your loved one. Easily analyze your nights to improve your sleep. SensePeanut App offers unlimited and free storage to let you check all your sleep measurements. Simply optimize your rest and recovery at night with these new insights: Bedtime, Time to fall asleep, Wake up time, Sleep time, Sleep cycles, Sleep performance and efficiency. 1 - Place SleepPeanut under your bed sheets Attach it to the top of the mattress and underneath the fitted sheet at shoulder level. It has been carefully designed to fit in your bed, as thin and flat as possible. You won't remember it's here. 2 - SleepPeanut works seamlessly Simply go to bed, SleepPeanut works seamlessly. During the night, based on your movements and body temperature, it monitors your sleep cycles while you have nothing to to do, but sleep and rest. 3 - The right wake up alarm SleepPeanut looks for the lightest and softest sleep cycle to wake you up — down to 30 minutes before your selected time. This is a proven solution to make you feel energetic for the rest of the day. A family of simple, useful and affordable smart sensors ThermoPeanut, GuardPeanut and SleepPeanut are a new generation of smart sensors designed to easily solve one of daily life's concerns at an incredible price. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Simple, Powerful and Affordable. How did you come up with the idea for this product? We dream of a world where Internet of Things is in every house, where every device is simple, powerful and affordable. Now, our dream is coming true with the SensePeanuts. What makes your product special? ThermoPeanut has been carefully designed so that everyone can use it in the simplest way. This is the very first smart wireless thermometer. It comes with an uncluterred App that makes it powerful. What has been the best part of your startup experience? At Sen.se, we are a bunch of passionate people who love what they do. Working together to create new amazing products is definitely the best part of our start-up experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yOmuaJi8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sense","source_asin":"B01EV1TWSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EV1TWSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EV1TWSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
