window.products.push({"id":461669,"name":"roundki Bookshelf Kids 9 Cube Book Shelf Organizer Bookcase DIY for Bedroom Classroom Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Book shelf 9 Storage Cubes Bookshelf 5 Tire Shelving Bookcase Cabinet DIY Closet Organizers for Living Room Bedroom Office Barrier material: Waterproof Non-woven Pipe Material: PP, Metal Shape: Rectangle Bookcase height: 124cm/48.4'' Per shelf size: 40.5 x 30 x 28cm/15.8 x 11.7 x 10.9''( L X H X W) Design: 9 shelves Function: Storage books, shoes, clothes, ect. Occasion: Home kitchen, Living room Package Content: 1 x Instructions 11 x large Panels - Placed sideways 44 x long Plastic pipes - Placed sideways 14 x small Panels - Placed endways 28 x short Plastic pipes - Placed endways 5 x Plastic connectors - for inside (with 4 ports) 12 x Plastic connectors - for outside(with 2 ports )1 xSmall wooden hammer SOME TIPS YOU SHOULD KNOW 1) When you get this bedroom storage at the fist sight, you may question its quality, BUT once fully assembled it's strong and sturdy. 2) Recommend sorting the pieces out before starting and to go slow, if you make a mistake it might take awhile to re-arrange the pieces. 3) Though it is a sturdy shelving unit, BUT NOT meant to hold super heavy stuff like piles of books,light to medium weight items are more preferred. 4）This product is designed to be used for large-area contact products. The panels we use are only non-woven fabrics, which play the role of separation rather than load-bearing. So if a heavy object with a small contact area is placed on it, it may break through the non-woven fabric and fall. 5) To assemble this kind of cube storage do need some patience. Generally takes 10-15 mins to get the tiers all set up; BUT 30 minutes and even more if you can't find out the best way to set up it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"roundki","source_asin":"B09JPGYHNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JPGYHNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JPGYHNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
