window.products.push({"id":461821,"name":"Pizza Dough Proofing Box, 14 x 10-Inch, Pizza Dough Container, Fits 6 Huge Dough Balls, Household Pizza Dough Tray With Convenient Clock, Stackable Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kY+LXGZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ MAKE PERFECT DOUGH for your pizzas, artisan breads, or french croissant rolls every time. The dough proofing box promotes professional level fermentation at your fingertips, that encourages complex flavor development and the chewiest texture for all your dough proofing needs. ✔ MASS FERMENT up to 6 dough balls sized for 14” crust pizzas. The food-safe dough box measures in at 14” x 10” x 4” large enough to fit fully proofed dough without touching the lid. ✔ AIRTIGHT LID snaps into place to secure the best environment for your bread and pizza dough to thrive. You can carefully control and monitor the temperature and humidity levels by using the clock feature, for properly hydrated, softer dough that’s difficult to control from other basic plastic food storage containers. ✔ STACKABLE & TRANSPARENT trays are perfectly stackable, so you can safely stack multiple dough boxes and save fridge space. The transparent dough boxes also allows an easy check on your rising dough through the container, without having to remove the lid and interrupt proofing. ✔ TRANSPARENT & STACKABLE allows you to safely stack multiple dough boxes and save fridge space. Being transparent also allows an easy check on your rising dough through the container, without having to remove the lid and interrupt proofing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kY+LXGZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BKZ69XM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZ69XM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZ69XM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":461822,"name":"P. Graham Dunn Bloom in Grace Classic White 10 x 1.5 Pine Wood Decorative Tabletop Stick Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51M9lcUeOZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In 1972, newlyweds Peter and LeAnna Dunn accepted a mission to open a home for runaway girls in New York City. In order to keep the girls occupied, they initiated a small woodworking business. The girls carved plaques and gifts that quickly became popular items at the Greenwich Village outdoor markets. When the mission in New York was complete, the couple bought the woodworking equipment and installed it on their farm in Dalton, Ohio. P. Graham Dunn is a family owned and operated business that opened its doors in 1976. In the early days, the work was labor-intensive. LeAnna and Peter were busy raising 4 energetic children and were running the business out of a revamped chicken coup. For twenty years, Peter designed every plaque, gift and each item of furniture while LeAnna managed the company’s finances. In time, the company began to computerize carving and laser operations and found it could successfully compete with offshore manufacturers. Today P. Graham Dunn serves over 4,000 accounts, most in the U.S., and the remainder in Canada and around the world. Farmhouse chic design gives hope, inspiration, and encouragement; Features sentiment reading \"Bloom in grace, grow in love\". Decorative sign is made of pine wood with classic tabletop block stick design. Measures approximately 10 x 1.5 x 1.5 inches; Great for placing anywhere - countertops, window sills, or desks. P. Graham Dunn products are designed and made in the USA; Handmade by artisans resulting in beautiful home decor. Individually wrapped in protective packaging; Ready for thoughtful gifting and inspiration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51M9lcUeOZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P. Graham Dunn","source_asin":"B07JGLZJJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JGLZJJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JGLZJJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
