window.products.push({"id":461878,"name":"Coffee Storage Container with Scoop - Airfresh Valve Stainless Steel Metal Canister for Fresher Coffee Ground or Beans (Vienna Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YEa8NfmuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AIRTIGHT SEAL, FRESHER COFFEE: With an air-tight lock, freshness stays in and Co2 out. Never again be disappointed in a weak cup of coffee or espresso. Lift the lid to a gust of savory coffee aroma. Air tight sealer ensures that your coffee grounds produce cafe quality cups. A sealable, locked and dry environment, free from notorious flavor killing elements (light, oxygen, carbon dioxide or moisture). 16 OZ OF TEA, BEANS, GROUNDS AND MORE: Ideal kitchen containers that can hold coffee, tea bags and so much more! Organization and preservation made simple with a full capacity jar measuring 16 ounces to keep you well stocked. Safely seals away what you need to ensure that the contents remain fresh. Pick a color - this canister comes in purple, red, green, black, blue, classic silver and more! 2 TABLESPOON SCOOPS: Bonus utensils for your canister? A stainless steel metal scoop to go with your matching jar and you're set. Pick up a heaping 2 tbsp of your favorite coffee bean for an additional cost of $0.00. These perfect accessories fit well in the jars, are quick to clean and durable. Easily store into drawers or hang it from the hole in the handle. The scoop worth $8 now comes free with every Kitchables canister purchase - small spoon large savings! SCOOP IT UP AT ITS BEST: Not so great at time-tracking? Don’t worry; we’ve got your back. A built-in calendar wheel clear on the canister's lids to help you stay organized. Twelve months and thirty-one days with an easy to read indicator to make your life easier. Manage storage dates or expiry dates and know when it’s your time for a refill! TRUSTED BY COFFEE LOVERS WORLDWIDE: Buying from Kitchables gets you a lifetime 100% manufacturer's warranty, no kidding. Whether it's our kettle, mugs or anything - if you're not satisfied, you get your money back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YEa8NfmuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchables","source_asin":"B01H4RX698","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H4RX698","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H4RX698","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
