window.products.push({"id":461949,"name":"TRANQUIL NIGHTS - 750 Thread Count 100% Supima Cotton Bed Sheet Set, 4-Piece White King Size Sheets Set, Soft & Silky Sateen Weave Luxury Bedding, Ext","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131LkfpYFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"750 Thread Count Sateen HIGH QUALITY LIVING - Slip into Luxury, exceptionally smooth and soft to the touch, the premium 750 Thread Count cotton sheets feature Extra-long staple supima cotton allowing you to relax into its cool comfort. You'll adore our luxurious cotton king sheet set produced for super soft luxurious feel which are breathable and long-lasting. Our Eco-friendly king size bed sheets retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft bedding with stylish picotting hem detailing. KING SIZE LUXURY 4 piece Bed Sheet Set - Each set includes 1 Flat Sheet: 108\" x 102\"; 1 Fully Elasticized Fitted Sheet: 78\" x 80\" + 20\" deep pocket and 2 Pillowcases: 20\" x 40\" (King Pillowcases). Fitted Sheet has deep pockets to fit mattresses from 9\" to 20\". Flat sheet & pillowcases come with a stylish picotting hem finish for a clean look. Highest quality dye materials are used for fade resistance. Recommended for regular wash and short dry cycles for superior softness. LUXURY AND COMFORT - Imagine the quality of hotel linens with the perfection of individually handcrafted cotton sheets, all at an incredible price. Our team of artisans measures each bed linen individually and stitches them to perfection. Natural long staple cotton fibers are used for the premium quality of these extra deep pocket sheets set which will instantly transform your bedding space. The fabric is tested to ensure no harmful chemicals are used, and it is defect-free. QUALITY CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX - Made in a vertically integrated factory certified for ISO-9001:2008, ISO-14001:2004 & ISO-18001:2007. SEDEX, OEKO-TEX and BSCI complied facility ensures sustainability, contribution to environment and corporate social responsibility. The fabric is thoroughly tested for meeting performance like no pilling, shrinkage, color fastness, tear strength and thread count authenticity before being individually measured and stitched to perfection. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We specialize in manufacturing the best king size sheets & luxurious bedding in the industry. These breathable cool sheets use specially compacted yarns made from 100% long staple cotton. The fabric used in these premium organic cotton sheets are sweat-wicking and temperature balancing to keep you cool during summer and warm during winter. Our designs match any décor and are a wonderful gift idea for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131LkfpYFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRANQUIL NIGHTS","source_asin":"B07LDBW32R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LDBW32R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LDBW32R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
