window.products.push({"id":461987,"name":"Bulova Miniature Clock Flower Cart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71opip8SpbS._AC_SL1187_.jpg","description":"Product description B0432 Features: -Enchanting flower cart replica.-Crafted of solid brass.-Crystal-bedecked canopy, wheel hubs, and handle.-Movable wheels.-Perfectly formed blossom reproduction.-Distinctive mirror-framed clock dial. Includes: -Includes engraving plate and walnut-finished base. Color/Finish: -Polished brass finish. Specifications: -Recommended battery type: SR527SW. Dimensions: -Overall Dimensions: 2.5'' H x 2'' W x 1.5'' D. Warranty: -1-Year warranty. The Bulova Story In 1875, a young Czech immigrant named Joseph Bulova set up shop in New York City, and a legendary American watch brand was born. Bulova was trained as a jeweler, and his expertise carried over into his watchmaking career, which began around 1911 with boudoir clocks and pocket watches, and soon evolved to include what was then one of the latest and most fashionable technological innovations: the wristwatch. Bulova introduced its first line of wristwatches in 1919. The company grew and prospered, and soon early radio and television ads were declaring, \"America runs on Bulova time.\" In the 1950s, continuing its legacy of innovation, Bulova introduced Accutron, the first electronic watch, and the first breakthrough in timekeeping technology in over 300 years. The Accutron timing mechanism was later adapted for use by NASA computers and a Bulova timer was even placed on the moon to control transmissions of data. Bulova timepieces have kept official time aboard Air Force One and have also served as official timepieces for U.S. Olympic teams. Today, Bulova maintains its tradition of excellence in technology and design, offering a diverse collection of beautiful precision timepieces for every occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71opip8SpbS._AC_SL1187_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bulova","source_asin":"B000RI1NWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-461987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000RI1NWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000RI1NWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
